rce-block-3279","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Fly - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3340","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Fox - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3401","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Goose - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3464","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Hare - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3526","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Lark - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3588","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Lion - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3650","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Mouse - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3713","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Stork - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3776","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Tortoise - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3842","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Wolf - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Crew seats","Named for Aesop animals"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3904","Fleet workers",["Steve Yegge's Agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3924","Named for authors; the essay names four of them.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Fleet workers"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-3977","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Austen - Wheelhouse Fleet Worker",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Fleet workers"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4043","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Homer - Wheelhouse Fleet Worker",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Fleet workers"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4108","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Plato - Wheelhouse Fleet Worker",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Fleet workers"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4173","Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Twain - Wheelhouse Fleet Worker",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Fleet workers"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4238","A parallel fallback fleet of five Sol 5.6 workers runs on Codex, named for sun gods, for when the Max accounts run dry. The essay does not name them.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Fleet workers"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4392","Seats and sessions",["Steve Yegge's Agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4462","A seat outlives the model that fills it, so these pages track seats rather than sessions. Renaming does not break the identity either: Lark carries all of Spider's history.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Seats and sessions"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4639","Not agents",["Steve Yegge's Agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4656","Wheelhouse itself — the harness. So is Gastown, its predecessor, and Beads, the issue tracker and knowledge graph underneath both.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Not agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-4801","The Portcullis — the system that accepts finished work and closes it out, freeing crew seats from idle-waiting on builds. Yegge lists its land queue among the crons, and elsewhere calls it an institution rather than an officer.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Not agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5081","The Castellan — his service dashboard and war room.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Not agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5139","Laurels — the recognition system that harvests spontaneous player praise, triages it, and injects it at agent startup, deliberately carrying no priority and no attached work so it cannot be farmed.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Not agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5343","The Forge — not one agent but another fleet of workers doing production fixes, managed by Person/Steve Yegge/Agent/Reeve - Forge Manager.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Not agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5491","The reapers, roombas, durability flush, and sheriff patrol — launchd and systemd units. The rule is that crons watch and models act.",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Not agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5630","Source",["Steve Yegge's Agents"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5643","Person/Steve Yegge/Blog/26/08/The Shape of Things to Come, Part 1: The Continuous Thunderdome",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Source"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/","source-block-5745","Person/Steve Yegge/Blog/26/08/The Shape of Things to Come, Part 2: Model Welfare for Agentic Engineers",["Steve Yegge's Agents","Source"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/Ant%20-%20Wheelhouse%20Crew%20Seat/","source-block-0","Ant - Wheelhouse Crew Seat",[]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/Ant%20-%20Wheelhouse%20Crew%20Seat/","source-block-31","Named among the Aesop animals the crew seats are called after.",["Ant - Wheelhouse Crew Seat"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/Ant%20-%20Wheelhouse%20Crew%20Seat/","source-block-97","One of the 18 crew seats in Wheelhouse, the bespoke agentic harness Person/Steve Yegge built for his MMO Wyvern. The crew are all Anthropic/Model/Claude/Fable/5 and are the work producers: they hold long conversations with Yegge, turn them into designs, and translate those into Beads implementation plans for the fleet to consume. Sixteen of the eighteen are named for Aesop animals, and the crew are his direct reports.",["Ant - Wheelhouse Crew Seat"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/Ant%20-%20Wheelhouse%20Crew%20Seat/","source-block-534","Named seats persist across sessions and even across model upgrades and renamings, accumulating history and accomplishments.",["Ant - Wheelhouse Crew Seat"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/Ant%20-%20Wheelhouse%20Crew%20Seat/","source-block-661","Source",["Ant - Wheelhouse Crew Seat"]],["Person/Steve%20Yegge/Agent/Ant%20-%20Wheelhouse%20Crew%20Seat/","source-block-674","Person/Steve Yegge/Blog/26/08/The Shape of Things to Come, Part 1: The Continuous Thunderdome, in \"Wheelhouse: Gas Town Redux\"",["Ant - Wheelhouse Crew Seat","Source"]]],"format_version":5}